THE EPISTEMIC CONTROL PROBLEM — Version 0.2

Delegation, Verification Capacity, Feedback Latency, and Reversibility in Advanced AI Systems

Second Theoretical PhD Draft — Version 0.2

Human-led, AI-assisted collaborative research

Author: Ouadi Maakoul + SI TEAM

