Research status and next validation requirements

Document status: Theoretical proposal, Version 0.2.

Not yet established: the novelty of the complete framework; the empirical magnitude of the probability-scale interaction; the appropriate confirmatory sample size across the multiverse of plausible model specifications; the generalizability of laboratory results to advanced AI systems; the relationship between decision-level controllability and institutional disempowerment.

